      "locator": "#site-links/li[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "My Sky",
      "sourceSha256": "e6ce26a3a1ae7daf33bc8899a067e791d7a3984d587865023bef58b892f40376"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0006",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[3]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Explore",
      "sourceSha256": "3b73900b8d29f963dece78edd4bd9529d855e50f2a3fcc39b3d66cd657630905"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0007",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[4]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Availability",
      "sourceSha256": "12f67f8539c46701e62d1c50254cf025c22a992b06fea6d4c0e19705f21f4cac"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0008",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#site-links/li[5]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "All apps",
      "sourceSha256": "01bed311e7d0c963a5f8afe3dd3c99c8140d887d92c602b94b9309fa51b32723"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0009",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Look inward. Look upward. Follow the connection.",
      "sourceSha256": "54a7b75a7af0a2a48a75b83f0b5be12826ec619cfa37e1a3ae9c75042aa80f5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0010",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[2]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Join early access",
      "sourceSha256": "ad15bb5a7b458a8929f40e30d83a46c78f3927e73890380ef79d3f2b4605ae00"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0011",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/div[2]/a[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "See what’s inside",
      "sourceSha256": "f93ebec1351e7cd3bff2df67bad375919e72451b9f355bfc43619fd7be1fbd2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0012",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#top/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "scroll to look within",
      "sourceSha256": "b4ed5666c45cf5c0b31b0ba239f822d532b4ec01203722f79f3ad38811950382"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0013",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#purpose-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "A doorway, not a verdict.",
      "sourceSha256": "0f01da5039850af16d7993a6124906d950da431bcd53ab3fdcb8f9b524b9b1c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0014",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Inner Sign brings personal reflection, the observable sky, and the human story of astronomy into one connected place. It offers patterns to consider—not rules about who you are or what must happen next.",
      "sourceSha256": "de1e3cfac3b5ab9352d74a1d0de006cba1b031f46dcb6825d6ba44977d7638de"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0015",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[2]/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Measurement comes before meaning. Every thread stays visible.",
      "sourceSha256": "2d542cb2a5fbc14df1bf85db7a3b19c128fb782e06ac6d68a8446f7379cef106"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0016",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#inside/ul[1]/li[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Today",
      "sourceSha256": "2b065c7c9ce466e5ebcad757987d5d660ee4c9ea708bc62c43444b53334738ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0017",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#inside/ul[1]/li[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "My Sky",
      "sourceSha256": "e6ce26a3a1ae7daf33bc8899a067e791d7a3984d587865023bef58b892f40376"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0018",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#inside/ul[1]/li[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Explore",
      "sourceSha256": "3b73900b8d29f963dece78edd4bd9529d855e50f2a3fcc39b3d66cd657630905"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0019",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#inside/ul[1]/li[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Your Calendar",
      "sourceSha256": "4606a66e61728dcd2e8219a649faa7eae8047ca3c3cef486c0204ad7730143e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0020",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Today · look inward",
      "sourceSha256": "145267c6b39670b7feb0dac3d81973d6d9a494e26f751e8e5f197d207083bca6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0021",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "A reading that belongs to you and this day.",
      "sourceSha256": "28522294a2ccfcd5bdb5241e333783195b0a68d33d67e47bd9cd450755192844"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0022",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Give Inner Sign one birth date. It meets a stable personal foundation with the changing character of the day, in a short reflection you can take or leave.",
      "sourceSha256": "e7972badc53e2a252d142fca2a17b7aa263aaa5f87693676def3040b43504b08"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0023",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Stable in you",
      "sourceSha256": "73995a208209714a30dd1971a834e703a0aa3cb8b83b5cd0907042b7ffd9d322"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0024",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Your sun sign and its Inner Sign third, your Chinese zodiac animal, and its element.",
      "sourceSha256": "caac4d69264f9695061d5dadde53148e5d1e601008aa42c040a1181cf534e8f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0025",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Alive in the day",
      "sourceSha256": "bad119a91869f70e1f7487b9ac30935a2c2a9870602e6e898a95f5612133ee3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0026",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[2]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The Universal Day Number, with its arithmetic shown, and the Moon’s current phase.",
      "sourceSha256": "f2d0e8be9cbcff920ef96956ba445b598ae6f4128e12e1b5fa1523187f7968c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0027",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Fresh, not random",
      "sourceSha256": "cc6b4ed3452bc23865e0b08caf301cf42162fda095faf510e175a2bb4f8103ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0028",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[3]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The same birth date on the same day always returns the same reading.",
      "sourceSha256": "4079908bee1e063482b7f98e3452164e47f0a3b98f7cfd9ef3e11e11ea41cd31"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0029",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every part opens further",
      "sourceSha256": "2f3324b27006cebca46b756fc09c865e99c055b4323b374dede3e44e209923b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0030",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#today/div[1]/div[4]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Tap a sign, an animal, the day number, or the Moon to open a fuller explanation. Every sign and constellation result and all eight Moon phases continue into a sourced Explore page; sourced pages for the Chinese zodiac animals and the day numbers are still being added.",
      "sourceSha256": "459c544c72fe1e0e1b6e0acc4b854dca2d03cbd554e548de6e31cde63495dd8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0031",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#lenses/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Two ways to read the sky",
      "sourceSha256": "4a1d4c11d3358a8c96d71d58842dc559ed31e741e8141d6ff0c0d48693483f4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0032",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#lenses-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Traditional 12. Astronomical 13.",
      "sourceSha256": "0b2c207148cd0ee5db582954b8b53ac52fac33dd0fcbbc545bb35d5b30f62e74"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0033",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#lenses/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Read your sign through the familiar twelve-sign zodiac, or through the thirteen constellations the Sun actually crosses—Ophiuchus included. Switch lenses inside any reading and see what changes for your birthday. Only the sign changes; the rest of the reading holds still.",
      "sourceSha256": "a684eccb872b4b064718585f21a53aeb11cba1d23975702de09b93b8a0a29f5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0034",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#lenses/p[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Neither lens is presented as the single proven truth. Curiosity is the feature.",
      "sourceSha256": "b02a43ea08c363c47d581567167720629ac40624441e34ae91787ff492bf5b11"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0035",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "My Sky · look upward",
      "sourceSha256": "c1c42d0e4aff568c031c4be1d3f3f16fd32bd830a536e86898a6985eb6236dc3"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0036",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "The sky above you, calculated on your device.",
      "sourceSha256": "358f18e5410526773366daa27113bf7da599f128f2b15773db447ade216cbee7"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0037",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Choose a viewpoint—a single location snapshot, or a city picked from more than 34,000 stored offline—and Inner Sign works out what it can from there, without a network connection.",
      "sourceSha256": "1556f7fa990176b8b98da0814d840f644f2e36de224863b535b5166a83fefc6e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0038",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Where Antares stands",
      "sourceSha256": "7861ca31e0df03f9dea924b292c2edf7538f5b291bf9c3d403ebc499a46ab910"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0039",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The bright red heart of Scorpius: above or below your horizon, which direction, and how high.",
      "sourceSha256": "9d5049b3acc141d191dfbcb04b7eaf9e86d7f6e2ca825ae118405f542049d350"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0040",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Finding Andromeda",
      "sourceSha256": "39359de9822211aae5e6795f7dcc1770bc6d3f9cc33664779d4b29ae3a1f90a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0041",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[2]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Where M31, our nearest major galactic neighbour, sits in your sky, what it takes to actually see its faint haze, and a direct path to its finding chart in Explore.",
      "sourceSha256": "bc53d42546de1c67577a7acf8c1a43e56cbd570b8e756c9bb5cacd8596c955f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0042",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The age of light",
      "sourceSha256": "87b22d2c9f0603f238d13168b8f6b5c80352d029148002bc76ec95b4fa95b25d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0043",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[3]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "How long the sunlight reaching you has travelled, the full journey of moonlight from Sun to Moon to you, and the roughly 2.5 million years Andromeda’s light has spent reaching you.",
      "sourceSha256": "5aeca9ba02bf47e787160da520a924a323ebcd43286f6f1b5066120cbb9af82e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0044",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Every eclipse of the year",
      "sourceSha256": "42342bb1fa8b7e86c33764241ebdace5e8cb308b7c64080e193658433598d456"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0045",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[4]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Solar and lunar, worldwide, with the ones visible from your viewpoint gathered first.",
      "sourceSha256": "472ef0a0ad36e18ec141091313b9ceeaf9e2123c4fb05f37586368983d4718e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0046",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[5]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The year’s turning points",
      "sourceSha256": "e24b96dbbe2e7a23885e3a1aeef2435e36802d822d1bb2ba62107d6633c12973"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0047",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#my-sky/div[1]/div[5]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Each primary Moon phase, the equinoxes, and the solstices for the year you choose.",
      "sourceSha256": "b05fd097f4af5332979907abf91d9adaf4ec437c385e0770fa7a04e052b59dbd"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0048",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Explore · follow the connection",
      "sourceSha256": "35f509fb93d61ae3753bbc2a462215e4c53a6492a1099454b1bb061d552d52ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0049",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Twenty-one constellations, charted from the sources.",
      "sourceSha256": "0abc2e9b9fc9200999ffee4a36ccf620781947ca6a4755a3239b3e713fbb87ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0050",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "All thirteen constellations on the Sun’s path, and eight neighbours beyond it—Cetus, Orion, Canis Major, the two Bears, Cassiopeia, Andromeda, and Crux. Each guide is drawn from catalogued star positions inside its official boundary, shows how long each featured star’s light has been travelling, and includes a complete star list for anyone who would rather read than look. Andromeda’s chart also marks the Andromeda Galaxy, M31.",
      "sourceSha256": "c23d19d029c1ccc0123b331df298e3166873e82912c78e8cefda1e392eaaba2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0051",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/ul[1]/li[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "A knowledge map that shows how constellations, events, people, and traditions connect—also available as a plain list.",
      "sourceSha256": "607ad3d175555a421388a389884887e9b646eec247726c962493fec18b55e198"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0052",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/ul[1]/li[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "An interactive Moon lesson: move the Moon around the Earth and watch all eight phases form.",
      "sourceSha256": "fcc54b4e66863b8d0bd2a992ed165feb50da726eea050c6911635f45e4434d09"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0053",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/ul[1]/li[3]/text()[1]",
      "source": "The Moon, the seasons, solstices, and equinoxes, each explained and linked to its sources.",
      "sourceSha256": "e1cd4318fd117ce3c06c5fd6e159440bfb60ba0748f1fa5a451cf3696a45ea73"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0054",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#explore/ul[1]/li[4]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Astronomy, history, cultural tradition, astrology, and Inner Sign’s own interpretation, always labelled as which is which.",
      "sourceSha256": "b0c066bb13b0ea66c3c6dff1ef49d6e130a729b98d98258bbc556d6a17fdfa4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0055",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#calendar/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Your Calendar",
      "sourceSha256": "4606a66e61728dcd2e8219a649faa7eae8047ca3c3cef486c0204ad7730143e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0056",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#calendar-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "The sky’s dates, only if you ask.",
      "sourceSha256": "9438104218dada8cabae36353ecbfb5f52088292cdeee0943879132d3fc14e8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0057",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#calendar/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Set a reminder for a single event, turn on alerts for the year’s Moon phases, seasons, and eclipses, or add the whole year to a separate Inner Sign calendar in Apple Calendar in one step. Adding it twice won’t create duplicates, and Inner Sign never reads your other events.",
      "sourceSha256": "af6d3d08ac3aa6ec85c7336609bf08d4c4ad36af1fcbb1d850b1c6f8b2236386"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0058",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/span[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Built for clarity and trust",
      "sourceSha256": "53fdee2c427c8c5121dd16b6760bbc0e1f7cff564f188d96c28f1cc9d40ef3d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0059",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Nothing hidden. Nothing taken.",
      "sourceSha256": "0b1ffd4721a1989fc9ccb201325972e7983a69e85fc9baa7d03295aaa0322059"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0060",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[1]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Private by design",
      "sourceSha256": "485ca594ccc9003ba4908cc7f0024a92ce2a89f2e3e49fb4acbc61770eff6580"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0061",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[1]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Your birth date and chosen city stay on your device. A location snapshot is held only for the session—never tracked, never saved. No accounts, no ads, no tracking.",
      "sourceSha256": "2ad537b12802e373efb0b137771a1a841fa609b82f491c3a1254d8d5d7b64f81"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0062",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[2]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Sources you can inspect",
      "sourceSha256": "ef9757a37a74284f08da0f0001bb5f03672cbc9be75e524743f08d62129f5e43"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0063",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[2]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Sky calculations and factual pages link to their sources, so you can check them and keep going.",
      "sourceSha256": "5d769961791513ecbc5a31217b6ad1da78787d251068841072f8e7b45ef77354"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0064",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[3]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made to adapt",
      "sourceSha256": "e6bd2b61b5a2802604d3c4b17ad33e1f83b025c657dd31e296b043c5129c199c"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0065",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[3]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "VoiceOver, larger text, increased contrast, Reduce Motion, and readable alternatives to every chart.",
      "sourceSha256": "4ce09bdcaf7bb01a756adaa696604eef158bc48638625f8c868b3aaffde9234b"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0066",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[4]/strong[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "A formula in the open",
      "sourceSha256": "435874d5b03742f970cd81dcc0436e6da23b183adf79925f7097da2855ff7577"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0067",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/div[1]/div[4]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "How a reading is built—both lenses, the thirds, the day number, the Chinese zodiac, the Moon—is published and tested.",
      "sourceSha256": "088db018f9167688d26a22c37d6743ea78664a8e7a71dfb905b5c821972fc489"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0068",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#trust/p[1]/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Read the formula for yourself",
      "sourceSha256": "e76932ff254ef186abc14244ea46dc42897781581fe75d9c46ef92999ac31897"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0069",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#blessing-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "An intention for Inner Sign",
      "sourceSha256": "f3cb50e5793d4c150eabc4579c6e97535ca09a1261e0d262c7eb4eae8979039e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0070",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[10]/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "May every lens widen curiosity without narrowing truth.",
      "sourceSha256": "ee9b78afca463289cd09058120d4fafa0788f3ff922de62a8230a925670359ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0071",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[10]/p[1]/text()[2]",
      "source": "May the old systems be treated with respect.",
      "sourceSha256": "f1d36704784ae8a14feba8c9ade5a06bd36fc4e0da6d8e03a45ca5fd837ba6b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0072",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[10]/p[1]/text()[3]",
      "source": "May the reading return each person gently to their own knowing.",
      "sourceSha256": "c419ec779053072bd232db8a2eb79c51a2b4e541b63ca05672b9e350e85074ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0073",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[11]/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "by Moving Truth",
      "sourceSha256": "3daa3456fa0b55162e7c72b8d69a3fff181d034edf3423bcf3ce5a972cf2aab4"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0074",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[11]/small[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Made with love by Skylaur Roe",
      "sourceSha256": "8973d1d4a4d34a688cb6e6d9080ec19b076e65b44fac74776e850e1cfb0f6562"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0075",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#main-content/section[11]/a[2]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Explore all Moving Truth apps",
      "sourceSha256": "1a8f383841d7faff0dd5d4232e122c1fc9c9cd70a6081e1df6caffd492edc277"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0076",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/span[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Where Inner Sign stands",
      "sourceSha256": "6960e43950f6e7036dafd45aef73ad26ff9462c5303e094806f4fc8ae43b674e"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0077",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability-title/text()[1]",
      "source": "Your place in the pattern.",
      "sourceSha256": "930fb711cc36065c557ae1eff4121f7daff878ac1d2a68145e326db0c14dd8a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0078",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/p[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Inner Sign is in development for iPhone and iPad and is not yet on the App Store. Today, My Sky, and Explore all work now. Every selectable birth date from 1900 through today opens a reading in English. Where a fully written passage isn’t finished yet, a shorter general one stands in while the full library of readings is still being written and reviewed. The app’s own translations into the thirteen other languages this website is published in, and an Android edition, come after.",
      "sourceSha256": "38d19027efb46baf3cf5696e89d9f999eb184951076f4154e485a477d369e6ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "inner-sign.index.text.0079",
      "page": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "#availability/a[1]/text()[1]",
      "source": "Join Inner Sign Early Access",
      "sourceSha256": "537102624fffc160501fcd9c0b91a3a1a43f08bcf5b3ffded1a8894c97e9b83c"
    },
